#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:4
msgid "Custom Columns"
msgstr "自定义列"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:6
msgid "Beginning with Picard v3, you can create your own columns in Picard's Cluster and Album panes to display additional information about your music files and albums. You can enter a simple variable (e.g., ``%artist%``) or a full Picard script to compute the value shown."
msgstr ""
"从 Picard v3 开始，您可以在 Picard 的聚类和专辑窗格中创建自己的列，以显示有关"
"您的音乐文件和专辑的附加信息。您可以输入一个简单的变量（例如，``%artist%``）"
"或一个完整的 Picard 脚本来计算显示的值。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:10
msgid "Opening the Custom Columns Manager"
msgstr "打开自定义列管理器"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:12
msgid "To access the Custom Columns manager:"
msgstr "要访问自定义列管理器："

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:14
msgid "Right-click any column header in the Cluster or Album pane."
msgstr "右键单击聚类或专辑窗格中的任何列标题。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:15
msgid "Click \"Manage Custom Columns…\". If the option is disabled, you must first uncheck \"Lock columns\" in the same menu."
msgstr ""
"单击 \"管理自定义列…\"。如果该选项被禁用，您必须首先在同一菜单中取消选中 \"锁"
"定列\"。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:30
msgid "This will open a new window showing the manager, where you can add, edit and remove custom column definitions."
msgstr "这将打开一个新窗口，显示管理器，您可以在其中添加、编辑和删除自定义列定义。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:45
msgid "Select an item from the list to edit or :guilabel:`Delete` it, or click :guilabel:`New` or :guilabel:`Duplicate` to create a new custom column item."
msgstr ""
"从列表中选择一项进行编辑或 :guilabel:`删除`它，或单击 :guilabel:`新建` 或 "
":guilabel:`复制` 以创建新的自定义列项。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:47
msgid "The details for the selected item can be edited in the middle section, and include:"
msgstr "选定项的详细信息可以在中间部分编辑，包括："

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:49
msgid "**Column Title**: The column title you'll see in the header."
msgstr "**列标题**：您将在标题中看到的列标题。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:50
msgid "**Expression**: The Picard script to compute the value. This can be as simple as a single tag like ``%artist%`` or ``%album%``, or a more complex script."
msgstr ""
"**表达式**：用于计算值的 Picard 脚本。这可以简单到一个标签，如 ``%artist%`` "
"或 ``%album%``，或一个更复杂的脚本。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:51
msgid "**Width**: The width of the column. Leave this blank for automatic sizing."
msgstr "**宽度**：列的宽度。留空以自动调整大小。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:52
msgid "**Align**: How the column should be aligned (left or right)"
msgstr "**对齐**：列应如何对齐（左或右）"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:53
msgid "**Sorting**: How the values in the column are sorted (Default, Case Insensitive, Numeric, Natural, etc.)"
msgstr "**排序方式**：列中值的排序方式（默认、不区分大小写、数字、自然排序等）"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:54
msgid "**Add to views**: The sections in which the custom column could be applied: Cluster pane (File view) and/or Album pane (Album view)"
msgstr ""
"**添加到视图**：自定义列可以应用到的区域：聚类窗格（文件视图）和/或专辑窗格（"
"专辑视图）"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:56
msgid "Basic scripting function and tag documentation is also available."
msgstr "也提供基本脚本功能和标签文档。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:60
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:63
msgid "Adding a simple field column"
msgstr "添加简单的字段列"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:65
msgid "To show \"Bitrate\" as a column in the Cluster pane, set the following values:"
msgstr "要在聚类窗格中显示 \"比特率\" 作为列，设置以下值："

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:67
msgid "**Column Title**: Bitrate"
msgstr "**列标题**：比特率"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:68
msgid "**Expression**: ``%_bitrate%``"
msgstr "**表达式**：``%_bitrate%``"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:69
msgid "**Align**: right (optional)"
msgstr "**对齐**：右对齐（可选）"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:70
msgid "**Sorting**: Natural (optional)"
msgstr "**排序方式**：自然排序（可选）"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:71
msgid "**Add to views**: File view (checked)"
msgstr "**添加到视图**：文件视图（已勾选）"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:75
msgid "Adding a script column"
msgstr "添加脚本列"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:77
msgid "To show \"Artist - Title\" with fallbacks, set the following values:"
msgstr "要显示 \"艺术家 - 曲名\" 并使用备用值，设置以下值："

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:79
msgid "**Column Title**: Artist - Title"
msgstr "**列标题**：艺术家 - 曲名"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:80
msgid "**Expression**:"
msgstr "**表达式**："

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:86
msgid "**Align**: left"
msgstr "**对齐**：左对齐"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:87
msgid "**Sorting**: Case Insensitive (optional)"
msgstr "**排序方式**：不区分大小写（可选）"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:88
msgid "**Add to views**: File view and Album view (both)"
msgstr "**添加到视图**：文件视图和专辑视图（两者都勾选）"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:92
msgid "For the best performance, any scripts used should be short and simple to avoid excessive processing."
msgstr "为获得最佳性能，任何使用的脚本都应简短且简单，以避免过度处理。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:96
msgid "Showing or Moving Columns"
msgstr "显示或移动列"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:98
msgid "If you don't see your new column immediately, right-click the header and enable it from the list. New columns are added at the end. To move a column, drag the column header to the desired position."
msgstr ""
"如果您立即看不到新列，请右键单击标题并从列表中启用它。新列会添加到末尾。要移"
"动列，请将列标题拖动到所需位置。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:102
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:104
msgid "**Column not visible**"
msgstr "**列不可见**"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:106
msgid "Ensure the correct view is selected and enable the column from the header menu."
msgstr "确保选择了正确的视图，并从标题菜单中启用列。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:108
msgid "**Wrong position**"
msgstr "**位置错误**"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:110
msgid "Drag the column header to the desired position."
msgstr "将列标题拖动到所需位置。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:112
msgid "**Script errors**"
msgstr "**脚本错误**"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:114
msgid "Simplify the expression and verify your ``%field%`` names and functions."
msgstr "简化表达式并验证您的 ``%field%`` 名称和函数。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:118
msgid "Best Practices and Tips"
msgstr "最佳实践和技巧"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:121
msgid "Performance Considerations"
msgstr "性能考虑"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:123
msgid "**Keep scripts simple**: Complex scripts with many nested functions can slow down the interface."
msgstr "**保持脚本简单**：具有许多嵌套函数的复杂脚本可能会减慢界面速度。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:124
msgid "**Use field references when possible**: Field references are faster than scripts for simple values."
msgstr "**尽可能使用字段引用**：字段引用比脚本更快，用于简单值。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:125
msgid "**Avoid redundant calculations**: Don't repeat the same script logic in multiple columns."
msgstr "**避免冗余计算**：不要在多个列中重复相同的脚本逻辑。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:126
msgid "**Test with large libraries**: Verify performance with your actual music collection."
msgstr "**使用大型库进行测试**：使用您的实际音乐收藏验证性能。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:129
msgid "Column Organization"
msgstr "列组织"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:131
msgid "**Group related columns**: Place similar columns together (e.g., all technical information in one area)."
msgstr "**将相关列分组**：将类似的列放在一起（例如，所有技术信息放在一个区域）。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:132
msgid "**Use meaningful names**: Choose descriptive column titles that clearly indicate the content."
msgstr "**使用有意义的名称**：选择描述性的列标题，清楚地指示内容。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:133
msgid "**Consider alignment**: Use 'right' alignment for numeric values, 'left' for text."
msgstr "**考虑对齐方式**：为数字值使用 '右对齐'，为文本使用 '左对齐'。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:134
msgid "**Set appropriate widths**: Leave the width blank for automatic sizing, or set specific widths for consistency."
msgstr "**设置适当宽度**：留空宽度以自动调整大小，或设置特定宽度以保持一致性。"

#: ../../usage/custom_columns.rst:138
msgid "For detailed information about the Picard scripting language, including all available functions and syntax, see :doc:`../extending/scripts`. For a complete list of available variables, see :doc:`../variables/variables`."
msgstr ""
"有关 Picard 脚本语言的详细信息，包括所有可用函数和语法，请参阅 :doc:`../"
"extending/scripts`。有关可用变量的完整列表，请参阅 :doc:`../variables/"
"variables`。"
